{"n":9,"title":"What's in your bag?","blurb":"Рассказывать о своих вещах","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"note","title":"What's in your bag?","sub":"","html":"<p>Твои вещи — и мир в цифрах: у 70% есть телефон, у 2% — питомец.</p><ul class=\"cp-aims\"><li>Называть вещи, которые носите с собой</li><li>Говорить, что у вас есть</li><li>Спрашивать Have you got…?</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Что у вас сегодня в сумке?","sub":"Здесь нет неправильного ответа.","options":[{"label":"phone"},{"label":"keys"},{"label":"wallet"},{"label":"book"},{"label":"umbrella"},{"label":"laptop"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"bag","pos":"","ru":"сумка","kk":"сөмке","def":"What's in your bag?","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/9b4e473e4de7.mp3"},{"en":"laptop","pos":"","ru":"ноутбук","kk":"ноутбук","def":"I've got a laptop.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/e068381bbd9e.mp3"},{"en":"wallet","pos":"","ru":"кошелёк","kk":"әмиян","def":"My wallet is in my bag.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/c307b632ca37.mp3"},{"en":"key","pos":"","ru":"ключ","kk":"кілт","def":"I've got three keys.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/a62f2225bf70.mp3"},{"en":"umbrella","pos":"","ru":"зонт","kk":"қолшатыр","def":"Have you got an umbrella?","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/3ff95ac9e6b1.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"map","pos":"","ru":"карта","kk":"карта","def":"She's got a map of the city.","img":null,"audio":null},{"en":"watch","pos":"","ru":"часы","kk":"сағат","def":"My watch is old.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/292b0901993f.mp3"},{"en":"car","pos":"","ru":"машина","kk":"көлік","def":"I haven't got a car.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/9e32521dd2f8.mp3"},{"en":"bicycle","pos":"","ru":"велосипед","kk":"велосипед","def":"I've got a bicycle.","img":null,"audio":null},{"en":"pet","pos":"","ru":"домашнее животное","kk":"үй жануары","def":"Have you got a pet?","img":null,"audio":null}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"She's got a","after":"of the city.","answers":["map"],"bank":["watch","key","map"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"2% of people have got a","after":".","answers":["pet"],"bank":["pet","car","bag"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"It's rainy. Have you got an","after":"?","answers":["umbrella"],"bank":["apple","laptop","umbrella"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"phrases","title":"Послушайте два предложения.","sub":"Оба — о вещах, которые у вас есть.","items":[{"text":"I've got a laptop.","src":null},{"text":"I haven't got a car.","src":null}]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"have got","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Лицо</th><th>Утверждение</th><th>Отрицание</th></tr><tr><td>I</td><td>I've got a bag.</td><td>I haven't got a car.</td></tr><tr><td>You</td><td>You've got a map.</td><td>You haven't got a pet.</td></tr><tr><td>He / She</td><td>She's got a bicycle.</td><td>He hasn't got a laptop.</td></tr><tr><td>They</td><td>They've got two cars.</td><td>They haven't got a garden.</td></tr></table><p><b>I've got</b> = I have got. В речи — краткая форма.</p><p>С <b>he</b> и <b>she</b> — <b>has got</b> → she<b>'s</b> got.</p><p>Для «нет»: haven't got / hasn't got.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Have you got…?","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Вопрос</th><th>Да</th><th>Нет</th></tr><tr><td>Have you got a bicycle?</td><td>Yes, I have.</td><td>No, I haven't.</td></tr><tr><td>Has he got a pet?</td><td>Yes, he has.</td><td>No, he hasn't.</td></tr><tr><td>Have they got a car?</td><td>Yes, they have.</td><td>No, they haven't.</td></tr></table><p>Вопрос начинается с <b>Have</b> или <b>Has</b>.</p><p>В кратком ответе нет <b>got</b>: Yes, I <b>have</b>.</p><p><b>Has</b> — с he, she, it, как <b>is</b> в уроке 4.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Смотрите и слушайте.","sub":"","html":"","examples":["I've got a laptop.","She's got a bicycle.","They haven't got a car.","Have you got a pet?","Yes, I have.","No, I haven't."]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"I ___ got a laptop.","options":["has","have","haves"],"keep":false,"answer":"have","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"She ___ got a bicycle.","options":["have","haven't","has"],"keep":false,"answer":"has","why":"С she → has got.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"They ___ got a garden.","options":["haven't","hasn't","isn't"],"keep":false,"answer":"haven't","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"","after":"you got a map?","answers":["Have"],"bank":["Have","Are","Has"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"— Has he got a pet? — No, he","after":".","answers":["hasn't"],"bank":["hasn't","haven't","isn't"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"— Have you got a bicycle? — Yes, I","after":".","answers":["have"],"bank":["am","have","has"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"cols","title":"have got или has got?","sub":"","columns":["have got","has got"],"items":[{"text":"he","col":1},{"text":"she","col":1},{"text":"they","col":0},{"text":"my sister","col":1},{"text":"I","col":0},{"text":"you","col":0}]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["a","got","have","laptop.","new","I"],"answer":"I have got a new laptop.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["a","pet?","Have","got","you"],"answer":"Have you got a pet?","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["got","She","car.","not","has","a"],"answer":"She has not got a car.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["She","have","got","a","bicycle."],"bad":1,"answer":"She has got a bicycle.","why":"С she → has got."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["Yes,","I","have","got."],"bad":3,"answer":"Yes, I have.","why":"В кратком ответе нет got."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["I","not","have","got","a","car."],"bad":1,"answer":"I haven't got a car.","why":"Нужно haven't got."},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/831c20c0463e.mp3","prompt":"У скольких людей есть мобильный телефон?","options":["17%","70%","7%"],"answer":"70%","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/c5ce5e873ceb.mp3","prompt":"У скольких людей есть машина?","options":["9%","19%","90%"],"answer":"9%","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/e45825d0603d.mp3","before":"40% of people have got a","after":".","answers":["bicycle"],"bank":["bicycle","car","pet"]},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/40ffcb833926.mp3","prompt":"— Have you got a bicycle?","options":["Yes, I have.","No, I haven't.","Yes, I do."],"answer":"Yes, I have.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/0e2cba2597f6.mp3","prompt":"— Have you got a car?","options":["Yes, I have.","No, I haven't.","No, I don't."],"answer":"No, I haven't.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/438ea6b155f8.mp3","before":"— Has your best friend got a pet? — No, he","after":".","answers":["hasn't"],"bank":["hasn't","haven't","isn't"]},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/3c09c334172d.mp3","prompt":"Ноутбук новый?","options":["Yes, it's new.","No, it's three years old.","He hasn't got a laptop."],"answer":"No, it's three years old.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/036532516168.mp3","prompt":"Сколько лет кошке?","options":["Two","Ten","Twelve"],"answer":"Two","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"note","title":"Прочитайте про Дину.","sub":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Dina</p><p>Hi! I'm Dina. This is my bag.</p><p>I've got a laptop, two pens and a small umbrella.</p><p>I haven't got a car, but I've got a bicycle.</p><p>My sister's bag is bigger. She's got a map of the city.</p>"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Dina has got a laptop.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"True","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Dina</p><p>Hi! I'm Dina. This is my bag.</p><p>I've got a laptop, two pens and a small umbrella.</p><p>I haven't got a car, but I've got a bicycle.</p><p>My sister's bag is bigger. She's got a map of the city.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Dina has got a car.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Dina</p><p>Hi! I'm Dina. This is my bag.</p><p>I've got a laptop, two pens and a small umbrella.</p><p>I haven't got a car, but I've got a bicycle.</p><p>My sister's bag is bigger. She's got a map of the city.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Her sister","after":"got a map.","answers":["has"],"bank":["have","has","is"],"why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Dina</p><p>Hi! I'm Dina. This is my bag.</p><p>I've got a laptop, two pens and a small umbrella.</p><p>I haven't got a car, but I've got a bicycle.</p><p>My sister's bag is bigger. She's got a map of the city.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"write","title":"Напишите о своей сумке.","sub":"Две вещи, которые есть, и одна, которой нет.","placeholder":"","html":"<ul class=\"cp-frames\"><li>I've got ___ and ___ .</li><li>I haven't got ___ .</li><li>My friend has got ___ .</li></ul><div class=\"cp-note__chips\"><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I've got</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I haven't got</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">has got</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">a laptop</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">two keys</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">an umbrella</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">a car</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">a map</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">a watch</span></div>","modelHtml":"<ul class=\"cp-checks\"><li>В предложении 1 есть <b>I've got</b>.</li><li>В отрицании есть <b>haven't got</b>.</li><li>Про друга я написал(а) <b>has got</b>.</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"record","title":"Произнесите предложения. Запишите и послушайте.","sub":"Сначала послушайте каждое предложение.","items":["I've got a laptop.","I haven't got a car.","Have you got a pet?","Yes, I have."]},{"stage":"Wrap","type":"checklist","title":"Урок 9 пройден","sub":"Урок 9 из 24 · Юнит 3","items":["Я могу назвать вещи, которые ношу с собой.","Я могу сказать, что у меня есть.","Я могу спросить Have you got…?"]}]}
